## Security Audit Confirmation

- ✅ No token, key, or PII written to any storage; no storage used in this handler.
- ✅ BrowserWindow carries full flag set; preload exposes only `onNavigate` with typed validation.
- ✅ No ipcMain handlers in this code; navigation is one-way (main → renderer) via validated commands.
- ✅ No vendor credentials; no network calls from this handler.
- ✅ No TLS weakening; protocol handler rejects non-https URLs entirely.
- ✅ Every incoming URL passes the single allowlist resolver; no link mutates state or grants authority; redirects resolve through the closed route map.
- ✅ No new dependencies beyond pinned Electron; lockfile should be committed by the project.
- ✅ Security decisions stated inline: https-only, exact hostname allowlist, closed route map, typed parameter validation, reject-never-repair.
